HHIISSTTOORRYY
       ppaammddeepptthh  was  new  in  Netpbm  10.32 (February 2006).  It replaced ppnn‐‐
       mmddeepptthh, by Jef Poskanzer.  ppaammddeepptthh is  backward  compatible  with  ppnn‐‐
       mmddeepptthh  and  adds  the  ability to process arbitrary PAM images and the
       ability to process multi-image input streams.   ppnnmmddeepptthh  handled  only
       PNM images and ignored all but the first in any stream.

